Abort does not compile:
| error: the crate `panic_abort` does not have the panic strategy `abort`

unwind seems to be recommended:
From https://github.com/meta-rust/meta-rust/issues/343
  Using panic abort leaves no cookie crumbs in the syslog, which is why unwind is preferred.
diff -aurN a/Cargo.toml b/Cargo.toml
--- a/Cargo.toml	2022-07-01 11:17:03.116316296 +0200
+++ b/Cargo.toml	2022-07-01 12:56:27.516715841 +0200
@@ -14,7 +14,7 @@
 ]
 
 [profile.dev]
-panic = 'abort'
+panic = 'unwind'
 
 [profile.release]
-panic = 'abort'
+panic = 'unwind'
